check 1
# The items channel (specs/tools/scenario-diff.md §3 rule 13) on a vendor's
# store fill: the NPC flow of items-vendor-akara-buy (the player poked next
# to Akara, monstats 148, then C->S 0x13 interact, 0x2F chat, 0x38 action 1
# = trade, world/vendors.md §3-§4) without the buy. Every store item reaches
# the client as S->C 0x9C (action 0x0B for the store), compared item by item
# with 1.14d: frame, action, bit stream bytes (code, quality, affixes,
# properties). interact-pokes (talk to an NPC by poke) is not built yet, so
# the scripted messages stand in for it.
name items-vendor-akara-stock
save ScnBuy --class ama --expansion --gold 5000
seed 1234
ticks 30
seconds 300
channels items
at 4 poke pos @player 4888 4228
at 7 poke pos @player 4903 4224
at 10 poke pos @player 4918 4216
at 13 poke pos @player 4928 4210
at 16 send InteractWithEntity type=1 id=@1:148
at 18 send InitEntityChat id=@1:148
at 20 send EntityAction action=1 npc=@1:148 item=0
